==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* [[alls staðar]]

===Etymology===
A contraction of {{m|is|alls staðar||of all place}}, from {{m|is|alls||of all}} the genitive of {{m|is|allur||all}} and {{m|is|staðar||of a place}} the genitive of {{m|is|staður||a place}}.

===Adverb===
